      "title": "C.H. Robinson Gears Up for Q3 Earnings: What's in Store for the Stock?",
      "summary": "C.H. Robinson is set to report Q3 2026 earnings on October 28, with consensus estimates projecting 22.86% earnings growth and 9.84% revenue growth. However, the company faces headwinds from elevated truckload spot costs, contractual margin pressures, soft freight demand, and rising insurance expenses. Despite a strong earnings beat history, the company's negative Earnings ESP of -0.58% suggests limited likelihood of beating expectations this quarter.",
